  "description": "Adopted by his new father, Rain made a promise he was supposed to never break. The promise: Rain must never leave the grounds of his home, otherwise…bad things would happen. When he wandered into the forests one day…they did. Years later, Rain is still confined to his home like a goldfish trapped in a glass bowl. Soon, he will learn the truth of why he can't ever leave…\n\n[Original Webtoon (Tapas)](https://tapas.io/series/cellfish/info)\n\n**Official Translation:**  \nS.Chinese: [AC.QQ](https://ac.qq.com/Comic/comicInfo/id/652840), [BiliBili](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc27871), [KuaiKan](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/16461)",
